   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A read-only investigator.\n\nIt collects signals from your\nobservability tools, builds a timeline,\nfinds the change that caused the incident\nand explains it with evidence.\n\nIt never changes anything.",
   "originalText": "A read-only investigator.\n\nIt collects signals from your\nobservability tools, builds a timeline,\nfinds the change that caused the incident\nand explains it with evidence.\n\nIt never changes anything.",
