   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Root cause (high confidence):\nMemory regression in payment-service v2.8.0.\nPods hit the 256Mi limit and restart; checkout\ncalls to payment-service time out.\n\nRuled out: database, network, node pressure.\n\nNext steps:\n• Hand off: scale payment-service to 5\n  → Production GKE Agent (approval)\n• Roll back to v2.7.3 → payments team\n• Draft status update (user posts it)",
   "originalText": "Root cause (high confidence):\nMemory regression in payment-service v2.8.0.\nPods hit the 256Mi limit and restart; checkout\ncalls to payment-service time out.\n\nRuled out: database, network, node pressure.\n\nNext steps:\n• Hand off: scale payment-service to 5\n  → Production GKE Agent (approval)\n• Roll back to v2.7.3 → payments team\n• Draft status update (user posts it)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "r220",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseline": 16
  },
